      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276831/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place pork chops onto a plate and lightly spray both sides with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aMqLwcqdxmx-USNV4GSbuLqsP_M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276831-Air-Fryer-Pork-Chops-ddmfs-step-2-120-588183ddd42247b286635732f8f941c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276831/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle both sides with ranch seasoning mix and let sit at room temperature for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EhUuq_EIPPfCxbAHAXUIecH5rr8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276831-Air-Fryer-Pork-Chops-ddmfs-step-3-123-77de2e417ddc42d48de6eff8c9c56028.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276831/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray an air fryer basket with cooking spray and preheat the air fryer to 390 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hBt1yz_VDPWkoAlI0T-3SCwApTw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276831-Air-Fryer-Pork-Chops-ddmfs-step-4-127-5cffaedaa312417d90b4734863642b99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276831/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches if necessary to ensure they are not overcrowded, place chops into the preheated air fryer. Cook for 10 minutes, flipping halfway through. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 145 degrees F (63 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_yRgwlEi3i1uuTxXVd1WZc0Cfqg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276831-Air-Fryer-Pork-Chops-ddmfs-step-6-134-3c9a961e87de40ff8cc5209b29678bd6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276831/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a foil-covered plate and let sit for 5 minutes before serving.",
